        <item>
            <title>0.11.4</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 19:13:59 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1104</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.11.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Jarvis 0.11.4</h2>
<p><b>The task finder now waits for a full answer.</b> On a busy Slack the finder's
model can take over a minute to think; the app used to give up too early and show
"Couldn't reach the model." It now waits long enough to finish.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Fixes the task finder failing with "Couldn't reach the model" on heavier
      workloads, by giving each model call and the finder's overall run more time.</li>
  <li>No changes to your data, your Slack connection, or what leaves your Mac.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
