            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Jarvis 0.11.3</h2>
<p><b>Restores the shared connection.</b> Jarvis's shared model service moved to
a new address; this update points the app at it so sign-in and the task finder
work again on the shared connection.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Reconnects the app to the shared-access service (the previous address was
      retired). If you sign in with the shared connection rather than your own
      API key, update to keep it working.</li>
  <li>No changes to your data, your Slack connection, or what leaves your Mac.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
